    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 114,
        "text": "Your seminar answer starts with a confident claim. What will you say if someone challenges the sample size?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "46b1eb290b61dd7f4bd39552f676001b9f86ebbafb7c555b7f17cb48927871d5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 121,
        "sourceEnd": 261,
        "text": "I should admit that twelve interviews cannot establish how common a view is. They can illustrate reasons that deserve further investigation.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ddaddbd891420ce03c7ca20c018f63ac210b98e410190acf1cdb1dd67fb4064c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 269,
        "sourceEnd": 338,
        "text": "Good. Can you explain that without apologising for the whole project?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b6c0c355855ae8a19b55fb8fe2d8691f700f37a4950cca8ad0d6aa9e8fb02e5d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 345,
        "sourceEnd": 495,
        "text": "I could say the study explores possible explanations rather than estimating population proportions. A larger survey would answer a different question.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a0a8aead58f545ce82a5b127f59f0dd8585d365ccdaaee61940fd61894251197",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 503,
        "sourceEnd": 583,
        "text": "What if the questioner asks why you did not include former users of the service?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "bc905b1357137a3090a765960de7b7d8e0be6cfe7962eb3a728b0c452d0daea6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 590,
        "sourceEnd": 754,
        "text": "I will say that recruitment through the current membership list excluded them. That is a genuine boundary, and future work should use another route to contact them.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "724ec9ed4ed17a7519e2278a3eb5b2e3a630f8b4f94144cd3dfcf40a378e92d5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 762,
        "sourceEnd": 823,
        "text": "Will you claim that adding more current users would solve it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "94ef3587270a559a02d971bf880ca607321ebd622b523bfdd3ecc5dc76efcc5f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 830,
        "sourceEnd": 910,
        "text": "No. A larger sample from the same list could preserve the same coverage problem.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9b443a950c084acad5e74112392b9d09076f7e11aca2075671e91c3c4de9a6b4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 918,
        "sourceEnd": 992,
        "text": "Finally, you have forty seconds for a response. How will you structure it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b5173b5094aafd2edd31ae6350477adb3d64917b835d59b9b1a853c9e0d95b4b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 999,
        "sourceEnd": 1155,
        "text": "First answer the question directly. Then state the evidence, name the limitation and suggest the next check. I will avoid repeating the entire presentation.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "eda271cc073b90d3345a33d612e7c1b5165e5b1d3d4182699bbdde5c1eb35f7c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1163,
        "sourceEnd": 1298,
        "text": "Try that sequence with the next practice question. The goal is a reasoned answer, not a rehearsed sentence that ignores what was asked.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2a81732a10d41903327cfa8cca2060be1425cd1cdcf08edaef9333353c26f813",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
